  "notes": "The preview endpoint gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview (2026-03-03 to 2026-05-25) and the stable gemini-3.1-flash-lite are one record; Google did not present the GA version as a separate model. The deprecations page names gemini-3.1-flash-lite as recommended replacement for gemini-2.0-flash-lite and gemini-2.0-flash-lite-001 (shut down 2026-06-01) and for gemini-2.5-flash-lite-preview-09-2025 (shut down 2026-03-31). The Google Cloud GA post is dated 2026-05-08, a day after the Gemini API release note and the Agent Platform release date. Vertex AI access is counted under api."
